# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-f2a8ddc785ae5659b823db41a74de96325ec0c61 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]].

According to the annex, the ordinary contributions amount to one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-c163cc6b02463bed79fb5693af6d67e4f6e6efe6 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].
